          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{COACH_NAME}} — strategic wellness coaching focused on lasting habits and measurable outcomes.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#ffffff;--ink:#0b1320;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#0b6cff;--radius:10px}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial; margin:0; color:var(--ink); background:var(--bg); -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:28px 36px}\\n    header a.logo{font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}\\n    nav a{margin-left:20px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    main{max-width:920px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 28px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px;padding:36px;border-radius:var(--radius);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(11,108,255,0.06), rgba(11,108,255,0.02));}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}\\n    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;margin-top:14px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(11,108,255,0.12);color:var(--accent);padding:9px 14px;border-radius:8px}\\n    section{margin:40px 0}\\n    .grid{display:grid;gap:18px}\\n    .cols-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}\\n    .card{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(11,17,32,0.04)}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}\\n    form .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(11,17,32,0.08);font-size:15px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    footer{padding:30px 36px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;text-align:center}\\n    .testimonial{font-style:italic;color:var(--ink)}\\n    @media(min-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr 360px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <a class=\\\"logo\\\" href=\\\"/index.html\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"/index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/about.html\\\">Philosophy</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/programs.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--ink);\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <!-- HERO (concise) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1 id=\\\"contact-hero\\\">Let's design your next level of energy and focus.</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Schedule a free discovery conversation with {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}. Practical frameworks, measurable habits, and an intensive path to results.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"lead\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"#connect\\\">Send a message</a>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px;\\\">Prefer a quick note? Call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- compact contact card -->\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n        <svg width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 120\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px;display:block\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#0b6cff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n              <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#0b6cff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.02\\\"/>\\n            </linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n          <text x=\\\"28\\\" y=\\\"68\\\" fill=\\\"#04233a\\\" font-size=\\\"20\\\" font-family=\\\"sans-serif\\\">Book a 30-minute discovery</text>\\n        </svg>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:14px\\\">Ideal for leaders and busy professionals seeking a focused, 8–12 week intensive that builds repeatable habits.</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"/programs.html\\\">See paths</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- VALUES: Core commitments (brief) -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"values-heading\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"values-heading\\\">Core commitments that guide our work</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid cols-3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Evidence-informed habits</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Small, repeatable actions with measurable outcomes — not one-off motivation.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Client-first structure</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">A roadmap tailored to your schedule, constraints, and milestones.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Accountability with flexibility</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Rhythms that fit into a busy week and scale as momentum builds.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- METHODS: frameworks & offerings -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"methods-heading\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"methods-heading\\\">How we make progress — simple frameworks</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n              <strong>Focus Ladder</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Breaks a big goal into weekly focus intervals, each with one measurable habit.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n              <strong>Ritual Engine</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">A repeatable morning and evening scaffold to anchor decisions and energy across the day.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n              <strong>Data Light</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Minimal tracking that turns habits into actionable signals, not extra work.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- OBJECTIONS: common concerns addressed -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"objections-heading\\\">\\n      <h4 id=\\\"objections-heading\\\">Worried this won't fit your life? Common questions answered</h4>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"I travel a lot — will it work?\\\"</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Yes. We prioritize adaptable habits that survive schedule shifts and time zones.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"I'm already overwhelmed with to-dos.\\\"</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">We commit to removing friction: one weekly habit, low-time tracking, and clear delegation where possible.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- TESTIMONIALS (compact) -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"testi-heading\\\">\\n      <h5 id=\\\"testi-heading\\\">What clients say after the first 8 weeks</h5>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">“I gained two hours of focus per day and a routine I can actually keep. {{COACH_NAME}} makes progress practical.”</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">— M. Stevens, Director</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">“Fast, direct coaching that stops the cycle of trying and gives repeatable tools I use daily.”</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">— L. Chen, Founder</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"/testimonials.html\\\">Read more stories</a></div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- LEAD MAGNET: subscription form -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"lead-heading\\\">\\n      <h6 id=\\\"lead-heading\\\">Get the 7-day Focus Reset — free</h6>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <form id=\\\"leadForm\\\" style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"email\\\" id=\\\"leadEmail\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@company.com\\\" required>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send me the reset</button>\\n          </div>\\n          <div id=\\\"leadMsg\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px;display:none\\\"></div>\\n        </form>\\n        <div style=\\\"width:160px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Includes a 5-minute daily plan and habit checklist to start small and win consistently.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CONTACT FORM: primary interaction -->\\n    <section id=\\\"connect\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"connect-heading\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"connect-heading\\\">Reach out — let's clarify next steps</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Full name</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"email\\\" id=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@company.com\\\" required>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"(555) 555-5555\\\">\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Which program are you interested in?</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"program\\\">\\n              <option>Executive Intensive (8 weeks)</option>\\n              <option>Foundations Intensive (12 weeks)</option>\\n              <option>Custom Corporate Path</option>\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Briefly describe your priority</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"What outcome matters most?\\\"></textarea>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Request a discovery call</button>\\n            <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email directly</a>\\n          </div>\\n          <div id=\\\"status\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:none\\\"></div>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CTA: final micro-commit -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"final-cta\\\" style=\\\"text-align:center;margin-top:28px\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"final-cta\\\">Ready to move from intention to momentum?</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Secure a 30-minute discovery session to get a clear next-step plan and tangible first habits.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"/programs.html\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:10px\\\">Explore programs</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // Lead magnet quick handler (no external services)\\n    document.getElementById('leadForm').addEventListener('submit',function(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var email=document.getElementById('leadEmail').value.trim();\\n      var msg=document.getElementById('leadMsg');\\n      if(!email){msg.style.display='block';msg.textContent='Please provide a valid email.';return}\\n      msg.style.display='block';msg.textContent='Thanks — the 7-day Focus Reset is on its way to '+email+'.';\\n      // In a real deployment, hook into an email provider here.\\n    });\\n\\n    // Contact form minimal behavior: open mail client with prefilled body\\n    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit',function(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var name=document.getElementById('name').value.trim();\\n      var email=document.getElementById('email').value.trim();\\n      var phone=document.getElementById('phone').value.trim();\\n      var program=document.getElementById('program').value;\\n      var message=document.getElementById('message').value.trim();\\n      var status=document.getElementById('status');\\n      if(!name||!email){status.style.display='block';status.textContent='Please include your name and email.';return}\\n      var subject=encodeURIComponent('Discovery request from '+name);\\n      var body=encodeURIComponent('Name: '+name+'\\\\nEmail: '+email+'\\\\nPhone: '+phone+'\\\\nProgram: '+program+'\\\\n\\\\nMessage:\\\\n'+message);\\n      window.location.href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;\\n      status.style.display='block';status.textContent='Opening your email app to complete the request.';\\n    });\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"}  \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# wellness_coach — zen_minimal (chunk 4)\\n\\nProject seed: 673089635\\nLayout family: zen_minimal\\nVoice: executive_coach\\nProgram model: intensive\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page and a README. The full site includes the following pages (links used across navigation):\\n- index.html\\n- about.html\\n- services.html\\n- programs.html\\n- pricing.html\\n- testimonials.html\\n- book.html\\n- contact.html  <-- present in this chunk\\n\\nDesign intent\\n- A very clean, spacious \\\"zen minimal\\\" aesthetic.\\n- Focused copy that emphasizes outcomes, frameworks, and habit-based progress.\\n- The contact page contains condensed versions of the required section pack so these elements ripple across the site:\\n  - hero, values, methods, objections, testimonials, lead_magnet, cta\\n\\nPlaceholders used\\n- Replace these placeholders across files when publishing:\\n  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n  - {{TAGLINE}}\\n  - {{PHONE}}\\n  - {{EMAIL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n  - {{COACH_NAME}}\\n  - {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n  - {{CITY}}\\n  - {{STATE}}\\n\\nContact page specifics\\n- File: contact.html\\n- Contains:\\n  - Compact hero with direct booking CTA\\n  - Core commitments (values)\\n  - Methods (framework descriptions)\\n  - Objections (common concerns)\\n  - Testimonials (short quotes)\\n  - Lead magnet form (email-only, client-side)\\n  - Primary contact form that opens mail client for lightweight deployments\\n\\nIntegration notes\\n- No external assets, fonts or CDNs are referenced in this chunk.\\n- The forms are intentionally lightweight: the lead-magnet form demonstrates a client-side UX placeholder; integrate with your email provider or CRM for production delivery.\\n- Navigation labels vary from other pages deliberately (e.g., \\\"Philosophy\\\" vs \\\"About\\\", \\\"Work With Me\\\" vs \\\"Programs\\\"). Ensure the link targets match the actual filenames in your project.\\n\\nProduction checklist\\n- Replace placeholders with real values.\\n- Hook lead magnet to an email provider (Mailchimp/ConvertKit/Segment) or server endpoint.\\n- Implement server-side form handling or a third-party form processor if you need to capture leads without relying on mail clients.\\n- Add assets and unique SVG files into assets/img/ as required by the full build (hero.svg, avatar.svg, pattern.svg) in other chunks.\\n\\nAccessibility & privacy\\n- Forms use basic required fields; add server-side validation and a privacy notice before collecting personal data.\\n- Keep copy outcome-focused and avoid medical claims.\\n\\nIf you want the next chunk, I will generate the remaining pages and the local SVG assets according to the project rules.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
